Recommends: systemd
Description: Manage Spotify Soloist as a user service with automatic updates
 soloistd is a small supervisor for Spotify Soloist. It keeps the Soloist API
 key outside the systemd unit, runs Soloist as a systemd user service, and
 proactively checks the official CDN for new builds.
 .
 When a new official build appears, soloistd downloads and validates it,
 atomically replaces its user-owned copy of the Soloist executable, and
 restarts Soloist gracefully. The documented "build expired" exit status is
 retained as an independent recovery path.
